0,Kiwai language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kiwai_language,"Kiwai is a Papuan language, or languages, of southern Papua New Guinea. Dialects number 1,300 Kope, 700 Gibaio, 1,700 Urama, 700 Arigibi, 3,800 Coast, 1,000 Daru, 4,500 Island, 400 Doumori. Wurm and Hattori classify Arigibi as a separate language.","Kiwai, Northeast",Trans-New Guinea
